# Rust / Tauri
src-tauri/target/
# Cargo.lock IS committed: this is an application (not a library), and
# reproducible release builds matter — the time =0.3.36 pin in Cargo.toml
# exists precisely because untranspinned dependency graphs broke Windows
# builds once. hashFiles('src-tauri/Cargo.lock') in the workflows also
# assumes the lock file is tracked.
src-tauri/gen/

